We developed an AI-powered cyber defense system for detecting and preventing attacks.
The system uses a machine learning model to identify suspicious activity in real time.
A dynamic dashboard displays live traffic, alerts, and threat status.
An alerts module is connected to backend APIs and updates continuously.
Risk scoring classifies threats into different severity levels.
When an attack is detected, the system triggers a verification process.
Users are asked to verify identity through OTP and CAPTCHA (simulated).
The system can block or allow actions based on verification results.
A recovery interface allows legitimate users to secure their accounts.
Overall, we implemented a complete pipeline: Detection → Verification → Response → Recovery.
